  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"In re-creating The Blind Man, the idea wasn't to canonize the original by making some refrigerated historical replica. Instead, the notion was to make a new Blind Man, asking for contributions from artists and writers whose works are completely modern yet seem to have some trace of Dada careening through them ... [T]he magazine complements the momentarily revived Dada Ball, a fundraiser for two organizations devoted to another global tragedy: AIDS."--Introduction.</subfield>
